   1 // Child process that runs the REAL start route (POST
   2 // /api/meeting-notes/[id]/ai/process) in-process, for the T12 tests that need
   3 // a separate server process: a crash after dispatch (killed by the parent), a
   4 // restart with the same ticket secret, NODE_ENV=production, and a lost RPC
   5 // reply. The route's TypeScript graph is loaded with jiti (the same `@/` and
   6 // `server-only` aliases as the Vitest config); `next/headers` is the cookie
   7 // shim next to this file. Every value it needs (local Supabase URL/keys,
   8 // ticket secret, fake AI override, NODE_ENV) comes from the environment the
   9 // parent passes.
  10 //
  11 // IPC protocol (child_process.fork):
  12 //   child → parent { type: 'ready' } once the route module is loaded;
  13 //   parent → child { type: 'start', id, noteId, ticket, cookies };
  14 //   child → parent { type: 'result', id, status, body }.
