 192 /**
 193  * POST /api/meeting-notes/[id]/ai/process { ticket, idempotencyKey? }
 194  * 200 MeetingNoteAiProcessResponse — a new operation's draft, or a replay's status (no draft).
 195  * 400 MEETING_NOTE_AI_TICKET_INVALID (malformed, bad signature, issued in the future);
 196  * 410 MEETING_NOTE_AI_TICKET_EXPIRED; 409 MEETING_NOTE_AI_BINDING_MISMATCH;
 197  * 404 MEETING_NOTE_NOT_FOUND / 403 MEETING_NOTE_FORBIDDEN (also when access was lost while processing);
