spec-interview/phase-6-meeting-notes/reviews/sol-review-blockD-r1.md:16:   **Fix:** Verify current membership before 
exposing a completed draft, retiring the scope on lost access. Update AC-033 to hold an actual successful route 
response after `route.fetch()`, then remove the member before delivery.
